 Sirens were activated on Ni=CA=BBihau for the hurricane warning.


*Kaua=CA=BBi Island Utility Cooperative*

Kaua=CA=BBi Island Utility Cooperative is reporting 90% of its 36,000-plus =
customers is without power as of 6:40 a.m. KIUC crews will=C2=A0prioritize =
damage assessments today in order to develop a restoration plan. Members wi=
thout power should expect prolonged outages. More information will be provi=
ded later today regarding the extent of the damage and restoration estimate=
s. Please stay clear of downed lines and report any that pose an immediate =
danger to=C2=A09-1-1.


