rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">L=C4=AAHU=CA=BBE =
=E2=80=93 Hurricane Lowell brought damaging winds, heavy rain, and high sur=
f to Kaua=CA=BBi overnight, passing west of the island early Tuesday. Wides=
pread power outages, downed trees, and debris have been reported islandwide=
, along with damage from wind and coastal surge.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">The public is urge=
