<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: calibri, candara, segoe, optima, arial, sans-se=
rif; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;">Do not drive throu=
gh flooded roadways or around barricades, and stay away from downed power l=
ines.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
