, emergency officials issued alert notifications recommending voluntary eva=
cuation for occupants of oceanfront properties, or sheltering in place by m=
oving to a second-floor area, due to storm surge impacts. Sirens were activ=
ated on Ni=CA=BBihau for the hurricane warning.</p>
